_erp_data",0,"vyyoussof/MMN_ERP_data","https://github.com/vyyoussof/MMN_ERP_data","This is a 128-channel ERP data set acquired from five subjects during mismatch negativity auditory oddball (MMN-AOP) paradigm by Garrido et al. (2007). The data was recorded by a Biosemi system with a sampling rate of 512 Hz. The experiment comprised of an AOP paradigm in which participants heard two different tones, a target (550 Hz), and a standard (500 Hz) tone. The experiment had been designed in a pseudorandom sequence, allowing for 80% (480 trials) and 20% (120 trials) chance of occurrence of the standard and oddball, respectively.  Ref:  Garrido, M.I., Kilner, J.M., Kiebel, S.J., Stephan, K.E., Friston, K.J., 2007. Dynamic causal modelling of evoked potentials: a reproducibility study. Neuroimage 36, 571–580. doi:10.1016/j.neuroimage.2007.03.014",0,65,"2015-08-25T17:58:50.000Z",16,4,70,0,0,[],3,1,"vyyoussof/MMN_ERP_data",0,0,0,0,8,0,"2015-08-25T17:57:03.000Z",null,null,""],["github:wadefelix/fo-dicom",0,"wadefelix/fo-dicom","https://github.com/wadefelix/fo-dicom","Fellow Oak DICOM for .NET",0,66,"2015-08-25T02:38:35.000Z",19,0,71,0,0,["https://gitter.im/fo-dicom/fo-dicom"],0,0,"wadefelix/fo-dicom",0,0,1,0,18,0,"2025-12-19T00:48:43.000Z",null,null,""],["github:walissonsilva/dicom-to-bitmap",0,"walissonsilva/Dicom-to-Bitmap","https://github.com/walissonsilva/Dicom-to-Bitmap","Código para a conversão de imagens Dicom para Bitmap",0,67,"2015-08-01T02:42:11.000Z",1,0,72,0,0,[],0,0,"walissonsilva/Dicom-to-Bitmap",1,0,0,0,3,0,"2015-08-01T22:59:14.000Z",null,null,""],["github:wangxueqzz/fo-dicom",0,"wangxueqzz/fo-dicom","https://github.com/wangxueqzz/fo-dicom","Fellow Oak DICOM for .NET",0,68,"2015-08-11T08:32:33.000Z",1,0,73,0,0,["https://gitter.im/fo-dicom/fo-dicom"],0,0,"wangxueqzz/fo-dicom",0,0,0,0,10,0,"2015-11-05T00:43:00.000Z",null,null,""],["github:xavierdr/oct",0,"XavierDR/OCT","https://github.com/XavierDR/OCT","Hosts all the different python modules and C++ files for the Opti